      "writtenOn": "2023-07-25T08:22:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "True, `HAS_TASK_HOSTCMD_DEDICATED` is never defined with the upstream. This define is used to create a shimmed task, which is not desired with the upstream. When a  dedicated thread is needed(tests), the upstream creates a new dedicated thread `CONFIG_EC_HOST_CMD_DEDICATED_THREAD`.",
      "parentUuid": "efbe27d5_ee045f03",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
